cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code, configurations and per-run results for: Selection bias in
  calibration checks during active learning for materials discovery
message: >-
  To cite the code and results reported in the paper, cite the release
  v1.0.0 DOI. To cite the pre-registered analysis plan, cite the
  prereg-v1.0.1 DOI, which pins the frozen plan at the commit it was
  frozen at.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Farahmand
    given-names: Kian
repository-code: https://github.com/kianfarahmand/propensity-calibration-al
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24146690
    description: >-
      Version DOI for release v1.0.0 (commit 1b2b7cee), the code and
      results cited in the paper.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23287243
    description: >-
      Version DOI for release prereg-v1.0.1, identical in content to the
      frozen pre-registration tag prereg-v1. Cite this one.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23287242
    description: Concept DOI, always resolves to the latest archived version.
